# Shell scripts must keep LF endings in the working tree, on every platform.
#
# This repository is developed on Windows, where core.autocrlf=true rewrites
# checked-out files to CRLF. A shell script that arrives with CRLF fails on Linux
# with "bash: \r: command not found" — including inside the CI container and inside
# the images, where scripts/check-versions.sh is the gate in front of every release.
*.sh text eol=lf
